      resourcefulness: [70, 0.55, "s", "A"],
      // [src_cerf_quanta, src_cerf_ap_icann, src_cerf_lemelson | 1998-2020 | Cerf interview + wire + institutional bio] Quanta dates the interplanetary-network idea to a 1998 JPL meeting and the bundle protocols to 2003, still being extended in 2020; the AP records seven years as ICANN chairman through power struggles; Lemelson's career list shows a multi-decade commitment to Internet architecture. Long documented commitments across several roles, but little about how he handled setbacks within them, so not higher.
      persistence: [72, 0.56, "s", "A"],
